#: ../../source/docs/common-install-gcs.rst:23
#: 1b084187508e444aaa5f9a6b285dd545 60b40fa2cb6843c3a5de36adef039236
#: 7100f9a9021940c198c2874aaaf85ff0 8a0b27b2bc6149488849b5562563bbdf
#: d310480541cd434db7eae2bc6524f5db
msgid ""
"`ArduDeck <https://ardudeck.com>`__ (Windows, Mac OS X, Linux): **Currently "
"in Alpha Testing -feedback welcomed!** A free, open-source ground control "
"station built with a modern UI. Supports real-time telemetry, mission "
"planning with terrain-aware altitude profiles, full parameter management, "
"calibration wizards, firmware flashing, visual Lua script editor, and "
"MAVLink signing. Also supports Betaflight and iNav via MSP protocol."
msgstr ""
"`ArduDeck <https://ardudeck.com>`__ （Windows、Mac OS X、Linux）：**目前处于 Alpha "
"测试阶段——欢迎反馈！** 一款免费开源、采用现代化界面的地面站。支持实时数传、带地形感知高度剖面的任务规划、完整参数管理、校准向导、固件烧录、可视化 "
"Lua 脚本编辑器以及 MAVLink 签名。还可通过 MSP 协议支持 Betaflight 和 iNav。"

